        "This motivates data-driven approaches: instead of writing every possible rule, let a system learn patterns from examples. However, AI is broader than learning. It includes approaches to perception, search, planning, language, reasoning, robotics and decision support.",
        "AI does not automatically imply human-like intelligence or consciousness. Most deployed systems perform bounded tasks. A spam classifier can categorize messages without possessing human-level understanding of them."
